  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41718134",
      "title": "Populating The Starting Page Content",
      "sourceHash": "5c6de88651fa798bbb8aae4debac2e02969217a0ba9a647d707532fee201120c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.37,
          "en": "Now that we finished the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "let's continue working on this main page content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 7.83,
          "en": "on this starting page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.83,
          "end": 11.55,
          "en": "And that means that we need to work on this page.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 13.41,
          "en": "inside of the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "So not any nested page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 20.25,
          "en": "but this main root page.js file directly in the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.25,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "Because that is that starting page we're seeing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "that's the page that's being rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "if we visit our address slash nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "so if we have no segment thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 34.32,
          "en": "And here on this page, I actually don't wanna have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.32,
          "end": 36.27,
          "en": "the content we currently have there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.27,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "Instead, my goal is to have some header here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 41.91,
          "en": "so not the main navigation header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.91,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "but some nested page-specific header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 48,
          "en": "that introduces users to this page, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "And then below that, the main section of this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "Now, since sibling JSX content is not allowed like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "we have to wrap that into a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 58.653,
          "en": "in order to make this work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.21,
          "end": 63.24,
          "en": "I also prepared some styles which we can use here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.24,
          "end": 68.07,
          "en": "and therefore, attached, you'll find a page.module.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.07,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "And yes, you can use CSS modules on pages as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 73.95,
          "en": "because in the end, that's also just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.95,
          "end": 75.69,
          "en": "a regular component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.69,
          "end": 79.263,
          "en": "Just treat it in a special way by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "But with that, we can import our classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 87.18,
          "en": "from this page.module.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.18,
          "end": 90.3,
          "en": "and then add a class to this header, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.3,
          "end": 93.543,
          "en": "to be precise at the header class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "Now in that header, I then later wanna have a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "which should receive a class of slideshow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "because here, we'll soon have a image slideshow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 108.47999999999999,
          "en": "or a couple of images that change automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.47999999999999,
          "end": 111.6,
          "en": "that simply show different food images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.6,
          "end": 112.743,
          "en": "So that's one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.53999999999999,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "In addition here, I'll add another div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "below that other div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 123.273,
          "en": "which contains two more divs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 126.57,
          "en": "where the first inner div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.57,
          "end": 130.293,
          "en": "will receive a class name of hero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 135.84,
          "en": "and that second div inside of a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.84,
          "end": 140.163,
          "en": "will receive a class name of cta for call to action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.51,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "Now, in that hero div here, I wanna have my h1 title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 150.74,
          "en": "where I'll say, NextLevel Food for NextLevel Foodies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.16,
          "end": 155.28,
          "en": "or any other catchy phrase of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.28,
          "end": 158.13,
          "en": "And below that, a paragraph where we could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.13,
          "end": 162.633,
          "en": "taste and share food from all over the world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.77,
          "end": 166.743,
          "en": "So this is simply some marketing text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 171.21,
          "en": "In that cta area, I then wanna have two links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.21,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "that allow us to go to different places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 176.79,
          "en": "and I'm still importing that link component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.79,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "so we don't have to change anything there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.91,
          "end": 183.633,
          "en": "The first link should say, Join the Community,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.53,
          "end": 187.74,
          "en": "and the href should point to that community page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.74,
          "end": 189.603,
          "en": "with slash community.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.5,
          "end": 193.92,
          "en": "And the second link should point to the meals page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.92,
          "end": 198.123,
          "en": "and say, Explore Meals, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "And that's now my header on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 207.963,
          "en": "We'll work on that slideshow later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.52,
          "end": 213.48,
          "en": "Now, in that main area here, in that main section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 215.55,
          "en": "I just wanna have some dummy text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 215.55,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "which I prepared for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 220.23,
          "en": "Attached, you'll find my page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.23,
          "end": 222.12,
          "en": "which is the same file you see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.12,
          "end": 225.72,
          "en": "just also with some extra sections added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.72,
          "end": 228,
          "en": "into this main block here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "and you can simply copy and paste",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 231.75,
          "en": "those sections into your main area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.75,
          "end": 233.91,
          "en": "or copy and paste the entire file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.91,
          "end": 234.99,
          "en": "which you'll find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 234.99,
          "end": 236.223,
          "en": "Whatever you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.07,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "With that done, you should see something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 242.91,
          "en": "like this on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.91,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "which I would say looks a lot better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.89,
          "end": 246.243,
          "en": "than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 250.59,
          "en": "But of course here, we also have this blank space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 253.59,
          "en": "where I wanna add that image slideshow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.59,
          "end": 256.443,
          "en": "and that is there for what we'll work on next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
